      "summary_en": "Vayne tips her bolts with a rare metal, toxic to evil things. The third consecutive attack or ability against the same target deals a percentage of the target's max health as bonus true damage.",
      "summary_zh": "薇恩用稀有金属制作弩箭，让邪恶敌人中毒。对同一目标的第3次攻击或技能施放会对其造成额外真实伤害，数值相当于目标最大生命值的一定百分比。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309989:3949891"
      ]
